gine/godot/pulls/119771","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-11T18:43:51Z"},{"id":4965580175,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ_i9jw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"0fa44d83f821aa1adfe377df16b765d8da025e5e","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"Thanks! I skimmed the code, and it looks good to me\n\nI also test all use cases I normally use when developing for Android:\n- Automatically installing when default export templates are present\n- Automatically installing when export preset has custom export templates\n- Using the original \"Install Android Build Template...\" dialog (both when export templates are present and not)\n\nThey all seemed to work great!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119771#pullrequestreview-4965580175","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119771","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-18T20:42:32Z"}]